  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1000,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 220,
   "text": "# Nemotron 3.5 Lightning — model  \nHybrid of **23 Mamba-2**, **23 MoE** and **6 attention** layers (52 in all). **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**; parameter and compute shares are the two bars above. T = sequence length. *Layer* tab = one layer of each type in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 350,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 220,
   "text": "Every layer = RMSNorm → **one** mixer → add residual. Layer rows are coloured by `layers_block_type`:  \n**Mamba-2** (SSM, 64 heads, state 128) 38.7M · **MoE** (6 of 128 experts + 1 shared) 1.30B, of which 80.2M run per token · **Attention** (GQA 32 q / 2 kv heads, no RoPE) 23.4M.  \nPattern: `MEMEMAEMEMEMAEMEMEMAEMEMEMAEMEMEMAEMEMEMEMAEMEMEMEME`"
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
