  {
   "id": "band",
   "type": "group",
   "x": -16,
   "y": -564,
   "width": 332,
   "height": 2120,
   "label": "52 LAYERS · residual stream x [T, 2688]",
   "color": "#94a3b8"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-cache",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 360,
   "y": -294,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "**What a layer keeps while generating**\n- Mamba-2: fixed state 64 heads × 64 × 128 + conv window 3 × 6144 — same size at any context length\n- Attention: K and V of every past token, 2 heads × 128 × 2 = 512 values per token per layer\n- MoE: nothing (per-token MLP)\n\nOnly 6 of 52 layers grow with context; the card lists up to 1M tokens."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-pos",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 360,
   "y": 26,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "**No positional encoding.** The attention layers apply no RoPE (`apply_rotary_pos_emb` is never called in `NemotronHAttention.forward`); token order reaches the model through the causal Mamba-2 layers."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-moe",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 360,
   "y": 266,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "**MoE router**: sigmoid scores over 128 experts, a learned bias (`e_score_correction_bias`) only for choosing the top 6; weights renormalised × 2.5. Experts are 2-matrix ReLU² MLPs (no gate matrix)."
  },
  {
   "id": "ho8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 42,
   "y": 1600,
   "width": 215,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
